-- al-Kitāb story, rebuilt on Sinai, Key Terms of the Qurʾān (2023), "kitāb" pp. 591–600:
-- the word (writing) → the Book with God (record + archetype, umm al-kitāb) → coming down → earthly Books
-- (Mūsā, the first ṣuḥuf, the learned of Isrāʾīl) → the jinn → what God writes (decree) → the record on the Day.
-- Existing steps keep their ids, so cards already filed in review stay theirs; new steps get new ids.

-- seq is unique per term: park the old steps out of the way first
UPDATE qr_keyterm_story SET seq = seq + 100 WHERE term_key = 'kitab';
